%% State diagram: vehicle status
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Available: dispatcher registers vehicle
  Available --> Assigned: dispatched to an event
  Assigned --> Available: freed, set Available or event deleted
  Available --> Maintenance: Set Maintenance
  Assigned --> Maintenance: Set Maintenance (assignment Concluded)
  Maintenance --> Available: Set Available
  Available --> [*]: deleted
  Maintenance --> [*]: deleted
